{
  "name": "dsh-web-artifact-designer",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "DSH 前端设计生成 Skill：把设计需求做成可直接打开的自包含 HTML/SVG 设计稿（海报/信息图/落地页/图表/组件稿）。Adapted from Anthropic canvas-design / web-artifacts-builder; zero runtime beyond markdown.",
